 it your own. Enjoy your cooking!\n\nVisual Guidance:\n- Combine water and sugar (or sugar substitute) in a saucepan.\n- Mix in cornstarch until the mixture thickens.\n- Add your chosen fruit and let it simmer for about 15 minutes.\n- Remove from heat and let it cool before serving.": -6.1875,
